# =====================================================================
# puller — .gitignore  (public repo — treat this as a security boundary)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# This repo is PUBLIC. Credentials are (correctly) injected at runtime
# via GitHub Actions `${{ secrets.* }}` -> `os.getenv(...)`. NOTHING here
# should ever be a committed secret. This .gitignore is the safety net
# that stops a local .env, a downloaded spacy model, a venv, or a key
# file from being `git add .`-ed and leaked to the public internet.
#
# NOTE: We deliberately do NOT blanket-ignore "*.yaml"/"*.yml" because
# this repo's ~40 GitHub Actions cron workflows ARE .yaml files and MUST
# stay committed. We name the specific secret artifacts instead.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Secrets & credentials (the important part; do NOT remove) -------
.env
.env.*
*.env
.env.example   # keep an EMPTY example allowed? -> see note below
secrets.*
*secret*.json
*secret*.yaml
*secret*.yml
*-secrets.yaml
*-secrets.yml
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.p8
*.b64
*.gpg
*.keychain

# (allow a committed, EMPTY example env so devs know which vars exist)
!.env.example
!.env.example.*

# ---- Python build / cache ------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyi

# ---- Virtual environments ------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
env/
env.bak/
env.old/
venv_*/
pip-wheel/

# ---- Jupyter / ML / spacy artifacts (large binary blobs) ------------
# The runtime spacy model is pip-installed (spacy.load("en_core_web_md")),
# so no local model dir is expected. IGNORE any local model blob that
# someone downloads/creates so a multi-GB file never lands in a public repo.
*.nlp
*.spacy
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.vec
*.vecset
models/
spacy_models/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Test / lint / type caches -------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---- Build / packaging ---------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
wheels/

# ---- OS / editor noise ---------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- Logs / scratch tmp --------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
tmp/
scratch/

# ---- JS tooling (in case a dev tool ever lands here) ---------------
node_modules/
